{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "失效导入路径检查默认规则。项目需按自身布局定制：packages 填 Python 顶层包白名单（为空则不查 Python 绝对导入，相对导入仍查）；javascript.aliases 填构建别名映射（键以 / 结尾、值为相对项目根的目录），为空则只查 ./ ../ 相对导入；roots 是 Python 导入解析根。已有文件的 packages/aliases/skip_paths 归项目所有，重装不覆盖。",
  "packages": [],
  "roots": [
    "."
  ],
  "check_relative": true,
  "extensions": [
    ".py",
    ".js",
    ".jsx",
    ".ts",
    ".tsx",
    ".mjs",
    ".cjs",
    ".vue"
  ],
  "javascript": {
    "aliases": {},
    "extensions": [
      ".js",
      ".jsx",
      ".ts",
      ".tsx",
      ".mjs",
      ".cjs",
      ".vue"
    ]
  },
  "skip_paths": [
    "**/__pycache__/**",
    "**/.venv/**",
    "**/venv/**",
    "**/site-packages/**",
    "**/node_modules/**",
    "**/dist/**",
    "**/build/**",
    "**/migrations/**"
  ]
}
